    <briefdescription>
<para>Compact descriptor for a maintenance schedule entry. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Passed across the orchestrator / persistence boundary. All fields must be populated before submission; zero-initialised fields are rejected with <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1maintenance_1ae1a42412965993222bd7e6ca427ee05baf9eda1609c7b45d5e676a071d930fe66" kindref="member">MaintenanceError::kInvalidSchedule</ref>. </para>
